❇️ **问题类型：[P1] 忽略状态码检查**

`getResponseCode` 会把仅返回 `st: 0` 的成功响应误判为失败。`download_content_remove_record_response` 中 `st` 是必填成功码，而 `code` 是可选业务码；当前逻辑只有 `response.st === 0 && response.code === 0` 才返回 `0`，当接口成功但不返回可选 `code` 时会落到 `return -1`，导致 `exportSubmitHitRecords` 关闭 `popup` 并提示导出失败。



**📍 问题位置**：[apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/stores/manuallySubmitVideoStore.ts:21-31](https://code.byted.org/ecom/alliance-operation-mono/merge_requests/736?to_version=4&dv_filepath=apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/stores/manuallySubmitVideoStore.ts&dv_line=R21)
<details>

**<summary>💡 修复建议**

</summary>

<p>按接口类型处理可选 `code`：只有存在非 0 的 `code` 才优先视为失败，否则 `st === 0` 应判定成功。可将当前范围替换为：</p>

```suggestion
const getResponseCode = (response?: { st?: number; code?: number }): number => {
  if (response?.code !== undefined && response.code !== 0) {
    return response.code;
  }
  if (response?.st !== undefined) {
    return response.st;
  }
  return -1;
```

</details>
<p style="float: right;"><a href="https://applink.larkoffice.com/client/chat/chatter/add_by_link?link_token=895t5202-d079-4e42-b498-a38e8950855a">Oncall反馈</a></p>

