❇️ **问题类型：[P1] 忽略状态码检查**

`getCandidateRemoveResponseCode` 会把只返回 `st: 0` 的候选剔除成功响应误判为失败。上下文类型 `candidate_remove_response` 中 `code?: number` 是可选字段，而 `uploadNoAwardRemoveCandidates` 依赖 `getCandidateRemoveResponseCode(response) !== 0` 判断是否阻断提交；当前成功条件要求 `response?.st === 0 && response?.code === 0`，当接口按契约返回 `{ st: 0 }` 且省略 `code` 时会落到 `return -1`，导致已成功的剔除上传被提示失败并阻断 `onOk`。



**📍 问题位置**：[apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/components/send-award/batch-submit-modal/index.tsx:44-54](https://code.byted.org/ecom/alliance-operation-mono/merge_requests/736?to_version=4&dv_filepath=apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/components/send-award/batch-submit-modal/index.tsx&dv_line=R44)
<details>

**<summary>💡 修复建议**

</summary>

<p>将成功判断改为兼容可选的 `code`：只要 `st` 为 0 且 `code` 未返回或为 0，就视为成功；其余非零状态码仍按优先级返回。</p>

```suggestion
const getCandidateRemoveResponseCode = (response?: { st?: number; code?: number }): number => {
  if (response?.st === 0 && (response?.code === undefined || response.code === 0)) {
    return 0;
  }
  if (response?.code !== undefined && response.code !== 0) {
    return response.code;
  }
  if (response?.st !== undefined && response.st !== 0) {
    return response.st;
  }
  return -1;
```

</details>
