**问题描述**: 这里用 `submitAwardVideoInfos.length` / `submitAwardAuthorInfos.length` 计算 `submitCount` 并决定是否允许打开批量提交弹窗，但后续必填校验仍基于 `selectedAwardVideoInfos` / `selectedAwardAuthorInfos`（例如 `getVideoMissingRequiredIndexes(selectedAwardVideoInfos)`、`getAuthorMissingRequiredIndexes(selectedAwardAuthorInfos)`、`checkAuthorValidityConsistency(selectedAwardAuthorInfos)`）。当用户当前未勾选任何项但存在历史遗留的 `pendingNoAward*Items` 时，`submitCount` 会大于 0，从而可能绕过必填/一致性校验直接提交这些 pending 项，导致后端校验失败或提交脏数据。

**优先级**: P1

**改进示例**: 把提交前校验的输入统一切到“实际将要提交的列表”，例如先按 `type` 选择 `toSubmitInfos = type === BatchOperationType.Video ? submitAwardVideoInfos : submitAwardAuthorInfos`，并用 `toSubmitInfos` 计算缺失必填项、作者有效性一致性等校验；或在 `merge*SubmitItems` 后再做一次对应校验，确保 `pendingNoAward*Items` 不会绕过校验路径。

<details><summary>建议变更</summary>

```suggestion
    const toSubmitInfos =
      type === BatchOperationType.Video ? submitAwardVideoInfos : submitAwardAuthorInfos;
    const submitCount = toSubmitInfos.length;
    if (submitCount === 0) {
      message.warn('请先勾选待操作项');
      return;
    }

    let missingIndexes: number[] = [];
    switch (type) {
      case BatchOperationType.Author:
        missingIndexes = getAuthorMissingRequiredIndexes(toSubmitInfos);
        break;
      case BatchOperationType.Video:
        missingIndexes = getVideoMissingRequiredIndexes(toSubmitInfos);
        break;
      default:
        return;
    }
    if (missingIndexes.length > 0) {
      setMissingRequiredIndexes(missingIndexes);
      setMissingRequiredModalVisible(true);
      return;
    }
    if (type === BatchOperationType.Author) {
      const checkResult = checkAuthorValidityConsistency(toSubmitInfos);
      if (!checkResult.isConsistent) {
        setAuthorValidityDiffFields(normalizeAuthorValidityDiffFields(checkResult.diffFields));
        setAuthorValidityConsistencyModalVisible(true);
        return;
      }
    }
```

</details>

