❇️ **问题类型：[P0] 逻辑错误**

批量提交前把 `pendingNoAward*Items` 合并进 `submitAward*Infos` 后再做奖励配置必填/作者有效期一致性校验，会错误拦截不发奖项提交。上下文显示 `pendingNoAwardVideoItems` / `pendingNoAwardAuthorItems` 是 `if_delivery=false` 项，提交弹窗中真正投放的 `deliveryItems` / `deliveryAuthors` 只取 `if_delivery === true`，这些 pending 项只用于上传不发奖名单；因此它们不需要满足 `delivery_config.effective_time`、作者领用/使用有效期或与发奖作者配置一致。



**📍 问题位置**：[apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/components/send-award/batch-operation-bar/index.tsx:414-437](https://code.byted.org/ecom/alliance-operation-mono/merge_requests/736?to_version=6&dv_filepath=apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/components/send-award/batch-operation-bar/index.tsx&dv_line=R414)
<details>

**<summary>💡 修复建议**

</summary>

<p>校验时仅检查实际发奖项，`BatchSubmitModal` 仍然接收合并后的 `submitAward*Infos` 用于提交不发奖名单。可将当前块改回只校验选中的发奖项：</p>

```suggestion
    let missingIndexes: number[] = [];
