Comments.Content:
❇️ **问题类型：[P1] 表单与用户输入**

`normalizeCandidateIdsFilter` 返回 `string[]` 会把剔除记录查询的 `candidate_ids` 传成数组。当前 IDL 中 `get_dou_plus_coin_remove_record_request.candidate_ids` 和 `get_dou_plus_coupon_remove_record_request.candidate_ids` 均为 `string`，注释也是“候选id列表（逗号分隔）”；两个表在 `formatEcopFilterParams` 中直接把该返回值放入 `candidate_ids`，BAM wrapper 又作为 GET params 透传，导致后端收到的参数格式不符合接口契约。



**📍 问题位置**：[apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/remove-record-filter.ts:1-9](https://code.byted.org/ecom/alliance-operation-mono/merge_requests/736?to_version=6&dv_filepath=apps/alliance-operation-content/src/routes/content-activity/award/remove-record-filter.ts&dv_line=R1)
<details>

**<summary>💡 修复建议**

</summary>

<p>将归一化结果继续按接口契约拼回逗号分隔字符串；两个调用方无需改动即可继续传 `candidate_ids` 字符串。</p>

```suggestion
export function normalizeCandidateIdsFilter(candidateIds?: string[] | string): string | undefined {
  const normalizedCandidateIds = (
    Array.isArray(candidateIds) ? candidateIds : candidateIds?.split(/[\s,，]+/) ?? []
  )
    .map((candidateId) => candidateId.trim())
    .filter(Boolean);

  return normalizedCandidateIds.length > 0 ? normalizedCandidateIds.join(',') : undefined;
}
```

</details>
<p style="float: right;"><a href="https://applink.larkoffice.com/client/chat/chatter/add_by_link?link_token=895t5202-d079-4e42-b498-a38e8950855a">Oncall反馈</a></p>

