Comments.Content:
**问题描述**: `exportSubmitHitRecords` 是导出剔除明细的接口链路，当前在 `apiDownloadContentRemoveRecord` 返回失败时只执行 `message.error`，没有同步记录失败分支、`code/st/msg`、`records.length` 等排查信息；线上用户看到“导出剔除明细失败”后无法定位是接口错误、入参为空还是返回缺少链接，违反 `toast-error-trace`。

**优先级**: P0

**改进示例**: 在展示 `message.error` 前同步上报错误日志/埋点，至少包含导出场景、接口返回码、错误信息和非敏感上下文（如 `records.length`、是否存在 `lark_url`），并在 `catch` 分支保留 `error` 用于记录异常原因。

<details><summary>建议变更</summary>

```suggestion
    try {
      const response = await apiDownloadContentRemoveRecord({ records });
      const code = getOptionalCodeResponseResultCode(response);
      const msg = response?.msg;
      const larkUrl = response?.data?.lark_url;

      if (code !== 0) {
        popup?.close();
        reportExportError({
          scene: 'exportSubmitHitRecords',
          stage: 'api_fail',
          code,
          msg,
          recordsCount: records.length,
          hasLarkUrl: Boolean(larkUrl),
        });
        message.error(msg || '导出剔除明细失败');
        return false;
      }

      if (!larkUrl) {
        popup?.close();
        reportExportError({
          scene: 'exportSubmitHitRecords',
          stage: 'missing_lark_url',
          code,
          msg,
          recordsCount: records.length,
          hasLarkUrl: false,
        });
        message.error('导出剔除明细失败，未获取到明细链接');
        return false;
      }

      if (popup) {
        popup.location.href = larkUrl;
      } else {
        window.open(larkUrl, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
        message.warning(`浏览器可能拦截了新窗口，请手动打开：${larkUrl}`);
      }
      message.success('剔除明细已生成');
      return true;
    } catch (error) {
      popup?.close();
      reportExportError({
        scene: 'exportSubmitHitRecords',
        stage: 'exception',
        error,
        recordsCount: records.length,
      });
      message.error('导出剔除明细失败');
      return false;
    } finally {
      runInAction(() => {
        this.exportingRemoveRecords = false;
      });
    }
```

</details>

