**问题描述**: 这里把 `pendingNoAwardVideoItems` / `pendingNoAwardAuthorItems` 合入 `submitAwardVideoInfos` / `submitAwardAuthorInfos` 后，`getVideoMissingRequiredIndexes` 和 `getAuthorMissingRequiredIndexes` 会对 `if_delivery === false` 的剔除项也校验发奖必填配置；这些剔除项在 `BatchSubmitModal` 中实际只用于 `apiCandidateRemove` 上报、不参与发奖，缺少 `effective_time` 或券有效期时会直接弹缺失字段并阻断“仅剔除/不发奖”提交链路。

**优先级**: P1

**改进示例**: 必填项和作者有效期一致性校验应只针对 `if_delivery === true` 的实际发奖项，剔除项保留在提交数组中用于后续 `build*NoAwardRemoveCandidates` 上报即可，避免不发奖项被发奖配置校验误拦截。

<details><summary>建议变更</summary>

```suggestion
    let missingIndexes: number[] = [];
    switch (type) {
      case BatchOperationType.Author: {
        const deliveryAwardAuthorInfos = submitAwardAuthorInfos.filter(info => info.if_delivery === true);
        missingIndexes = getAuthorMissingRequiredIndexes(deliveryAwardAuthorInfos);
        break;
      }
      case BatchOperationType.Video: {
        const deliveryAwardVideoInfos = submitAwardVideoInfos.filter(info => info.if_delivery === true);
        missingIndexes = getVideoMissingRequiredIndexes(deliveryAwardVideoInfos);
        break;
      }
      default:
        return;
    }
```

</details>

